{
    "comment": "댓글 구획 전체 — 목록은 평평한 배열 하나이고 계층은 «들여쓰기»로만 낸다(깊이 × 1rem, 10단에서 멈춘다). 대댓글이 보일지는 그 줄의 뿌리 원댓글이 펼쳐져 있는지로 갈리고, 뿌리를 찾는 표는 부모 화면의 계산값(`commentRootMap`)이 준다. 아래에는 답글 칸과 새 댓글 칸 둘이 따로 있고 각자 자기 저장 상태를 쓴다",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Admin Board Post Detail - Comments Section (Header Separated)"
    },
    "id": "comments_section",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{post?.data?.board?.use_comment}}",
    "props": {
        "className": "mt-6"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "comments_header",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex-center gap-2 px-6 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 pb-2"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "comments",
                        "className": "text-xl text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H3",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "section-heading"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.comments_title|count={{post?.data?.comment_count ?? 0}}"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "comments_card",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "comments_list_container",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(post?.data?.comment_count ?? 0) > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": ""
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "comment_wrapper_{{idx}}",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "post?.data?.comments ?? []",
                                "item_var": "comment",
                                "index_var": "idx"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "comment_visible_{{idx}}",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{(comment?.depth ?? 0) === 0 || (_local.collapsedReplies?.[$computed.commentRootMap?.[comment.id]] === false)}}",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "comment_item_{{idx}}",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors",
                                                "style": {
                                                    "marginLeft": "{{Math.min(comment.depth ?? 0, 10) * 1}}rem"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "partial": "_comment.json"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reply_form_for_comment_{{idx}}",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{_local.replyingTo === comment.id && post?.data?.status !== 'blinded' && post?.data?.status !== 'deleted' && !post?.data?.deleted_at}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "px-4 panel-header",
                                                "style": {
                                                    "marginLeft": "{{Math.min((comment.depth ?? 0) + 1, 10) * 1}}rem"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex-start gap-2 mb-2"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "name": "turn-up",
                                                                        "className": "text-sm rotate-90 mt-1 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "text-label"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.replying_to|name={{comment.author.name}}"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Textarea",
                                                            "actions": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "comment": "답글 입력을 담는다 — 답글 칸은 한 번에 하나만 열리므로 어느 댓글에 다는지는 이 값이 아니라 `replyingTo` 가 들고 있다",
                                                                    "type": "input",
                                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "target": "local",
                                                                        "reply_comment_content": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            ],
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "value": "{{_local.reply_comment_content ?? ''}}",
                                                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.reply_placeholder",
                                                                "rows": 2,
                                                                "disabled": "{{post?.data?.abilities?.can_write_comments !== true}}",
                                                                "className": "text-primary w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 mb-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex justify-end gap-2"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Button",
                                                                    "actions": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "comment": "답글 칸을 닫는다 — 적던 내용은 비우지 않으므로 다시 열면 그대로 남아 있다",
                                                                            "type": "click",
                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                                "replyingTo": null
                                                                            }
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "px-3 py-1.5 text-body bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "children": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.cancel"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Button",
                                                                    "actions": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "comment": "답글 등록 — 부모 댓글의 id 와 그보다 한 단 깊은 깊이를 함께 보낸다. 성공하면 글 전체를 다시 읽어 새 답글이 제자리(부모 아래)에 끼워지게 한다",
                                                                            "type": "click",
                                                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                                                            "if": "{{_local.replySubmitting !== true}}",
                                                                            "actions": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                                                    "params": {
                                                                                        "target": "local",
                                                                                        "replySubmitting": true
                                                                                    }
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                                                    "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-board/admin/board/{{route.slug}}/posts/{{comment?.post_id}}/comments",
                                                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                                                    "params": {
                                                                                        "method": "POST",
                                                                                        "body": {
                                                                                            "content": "{{_local.reply_comment_content}}",
                                                                                            "parent_id": "{{comment?.id}}",
                                                                                            "depth": "{{(comment?.depth ?? 0) + 1}}"
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    },
                                                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                                "dataSourceId": "post"
                                                                                            }
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                                                "replyingTo": null,
                                                                                                "replyingToPostId": null,
                                                                                                "replyingToDepth": null,
                                                                                                "reply_comment_content": "",
                                                                                                "replySubmitting": false
                                                                                            }
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                                "type": "success",
                                                                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.reply_submit_success"
                                                                                            }
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ],
                                                                                    "onError": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                                                "replySubmitting": false
                                                                                            }
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                                "type": "error",
                                                                                                "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                                                            }
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                                        "disabled": "{{post?.data?.abilities?.can_write_comments !== true || _local.replySubmitting === true}}"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "children": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                                            "props": {
                                                                                "className": "flex-center gap-2"
                                                                            },
                                                                            "children": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                                    "if": "{{!_local.replySubmitting}}",
                                                                                    "props": {
                                                                                        "name": "paper-plane",
                                                                                        "className": "text-base"
                                                                                    }
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                                    "if": "{{_local.replySubmitting}}",
                                                                                    "props": {
                                                                                        "name": "spinner",
                                                                                        "className": "spinner-sm"
                                                                                    }
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                                    "text": "{{_local.replySubmitting ? '$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.reply_submitting' : '$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.reply'}}"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "no_comments_message",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(post?.data?.comment_count ?? 0) === 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "p-12 text-center"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "comment",
                                "className": "text-5xl mx-auto mb-3 text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-label-subtle"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.no_comments"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "comment_input_section",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{post?.data?.board?.use_comment && post?.data?.status !== 'blinded' && post?.data?.status !== 'deleted' && !post?.data?.deleted_at}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "p-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-start gap-3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "user-circle",
                                        "className": "text-[2rem] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-1"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex-1"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Textarea",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "맨 아래 새 댓글 칸 — 답글 칸과 다른 값을 써서 둘을 동시에 적어도 서로 섞이지 않는다",
                                                    "type": "input",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "new_comment_content": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "value": "{{_local.new_comment_content ?? ''}}",
                                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.comment_placeholder",
                                                "rows": 3,
                                                "disabled": "{{post?.data?.abilities?.can_write_comments !== true}}",
                                                "className": "text-primary w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 dark:focus:ring-blue-400 focus:border-blue-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex justify-end mt-2"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Button",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "comment": "새 댓글 등록 — 부모가 없으므로 답글과 달리 `parent_id`·`depth` 를 보내지 않는다. 성공하면 입력칸을 비운다(답글 쪽은 칸 자체가 닫히므로 비우는 자리가 다르다)",
                                                            "type": "click",
                                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                                            "if": "{{_local.commentSubmitting !== true}}",
                                                            "actions": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "target": "local",
                                                                        "commentSubmitting": true
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                                    "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-board/admin/board/{{route.slug}}/posts/{{route.id}}/comments",
                                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "method": "POST",
                                                                        "body": {
                                                                            "content": "{{_local.new_comment_content}}"
                                                                        }
                                                                    },
                                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "dataSourceId": "post"
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                                "new_comment_content": "",
                                                                                "commentSubmitting": false
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "type": "success",
                                                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.comment_submit_success"
                                                                            }
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],
                                                                    "onError": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                                "commentSubmitting": false
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "type": "error",
                                                                                "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                                            }
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "px-4 py-2 text-sm bg-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                        "disabled": "{{post?.data?.abilities?.can_write_comments !== true || _local.commentSubmitting === true}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex-center gap-2"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                    "if": "{{!_local.commentSubmitting}}",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "name": "paper-plane",
                                                                        "className": "text-base"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                    "if": "{{_local.commentSubmitting}}",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "name": "spinner",
                                                                        "className": "spinner-sm"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "text": "{{_local.commentSubmitting ? '$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.comment_submitting' : '$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.detail.comment_submit'}}"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
